    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28441" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δροσ-ερός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρόσος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dewy, watery,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθήρ, πηγαί,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				865
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1335
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεφέλαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					338
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); <i>dewy, fresh,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάχανα</span>”
